python
# Overall_Sunlight_Intensity
# Feature description: Compute the average of Hillshade_9am, Hillshade_Noon, and Hillshade_3pm to measure total daily sunlight exposure.
# Usefulness: Sunlight exposure drives vegetation growth and forest cover patterns. A consolidated metric simplifies time-based variability and captures cumulative sunlight intensity throughout the day.
