### Step 3: Wilderness_Soil_Composition
python
# Wilderness_Soil_Composition
# Feature description: Combine all Wilderness Area indicators and Soil Type indicators into a single feature by summing their values for each point.
# Usefulness: This feature summarizes the ecological and soil diversity of a location, leveraging interactions between regional wilderness zones and soil variability to better capture environmental factors affecting forest cover types.
df['Wilderness_Soil_Composition'] = df[['Wilderness_Area1', 'Wilderness_Area2', 'Wilderness_Area3', 'Wilderness_Area4']].sum(axis=1) + df[[col for col in df.columns if 'Soil_Type' in col]].sum(axis=1)
end

