### Step 2: Hydrology_Overall_Proximity
python
# Hydrology_Overall_Proximity
# Feature description: Calculate the harmonic mean of Horizontal_Distance_To_Hydrology and Vertical_Distance_To_Hydrology.
# Usefulness: The harmonic mean emphasizes smaller values (closer distances), better capturing the hydrological influence of proximity compared to arithmetic or geometric means. This highlights areas close to water sources, relevant for forest cover predictions.
df['Hydrology_Overall_Proximity'] = 2 / ((1 / (df['Horizontal_Distance_To_Hydrology'] + 1e-6)) + (1 / (df['Vertical_Distance_To_Hydrology'] + 1e-6)))  # Adding small constants to avoid division by zero
end

